  "description": "The Revolution MX is our newest and most capable Revolution ever! The MX is all about blending lightweight e-bike performance with moto like power, something never done before!\n\nNo expenses were spared to create this one of a kind, top of the line performance king! Exotic building materials such as 6061 aluminum, 7075 aluminum, carbon fiber are all beautifully manufactured and machined to our exact specifications and then welded right here in California.\n\nAt the center of the Revolution MX is the CYC Pro Gen 4 motor system, capable of pushing 6000W. With our custom 5 speed transmission, you'll be able to have both insane climbing prowess and high stop speeds, in one package.\n\nThe incredible amount of acceleration and speed meant sourcing the some of the best performing brakes we can find; the Magura MT5 quad piston performance brakes, mated to the 203mm MDR-C rotors. This bike stops better than anything we have ever tested! To safely operate this performance bike, we have taken considerable time to dial in the suspension, needless to say, it is like floating on a cloud!\n\nThe Revolution MX offers up massive power with 6,000W and 72V battery system It can reach speeds of 50+ mph!\n\nWe have paired the Revolution MX with a completely custom drivetrain, capable of reliably handling all this power. A custom rear hub, custom 5 speed cassette, a high performance chain for high power, and custom derailleur system with integrated clutch make this perform as well as it look!\n\nUnlike other bikes on the market in this category, the Revolution MX has 5 speeds, giving the motor extra torque and extra speed. You'll always find the right gear for the trail!\n\n*Off road mode must be enabled on private property, Bike will ship fully compliant with Class 2 laws (750W/20 mph)",
